sentences.text:
The interim bail granted to the petitioner is confirmed subject to the following conditions:
(a) Petitioner shall appear before the Investigating Officer and execute a bond for a sum of Rs.2,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum to the satisfaction of the Investigating Officer;
NC: 2023:KHC:41402 (b) Petitioner shall not directly or indirectly make attempts to tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
(c) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons.

